## SUMMARY
- Plan is **not clean**: two hard contradictions on A-loop (migration map; revalidation V-without-A) plus ambiguous §5 V-loop placement vs locked **I→A→V**.
- Clarify Advisor/Knowledge intent is in Locked decisions, but **traceability/Doctor/VAL** still treat quality as mostly I (+ Iterate), orphaning A-loop and K/L gates.
- Authorizer rename is mostly done; **`broker_contiguous_watermark`** is a remaining Broker leak.
- Toolstack and route-catalog locking need Clarify-table fidelity and APO→lock pinning so an implementer does not guess.
- Fix F-1–F-3 before implementation; F-4–F-9 before claiming executability / release readiness.
